# Null-test case for the reverb golden render (Story 2.10, type plate): the golden test-tone MIDI with part 0 sending to the reverb, then a 1 s tail
# (the tail is the reverb ringing out: the dry render has none). -100 dB residual: far below the audible effect of the settings, loose
# enough for libm/FMA differences between macOS and Linux builds. check_excess: a tail in one file only fails as well.
reference=fx_reverb_plate.wav
tolerance_db=-100
max_offset_frames=0
max_length_diff_frames=0
check_excess=1
